========================================
   .ENV TEMPLATE — COPY KE FILE .env
========================================
Isi dengan nilai asli, lalu rename jadi .env


----------------------------------------
TELEGRAM (wajib)
----------------------------------------
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=paste_token_dari_botfather_disini


----------------------------------------
TWELVE DATA (opsional, untuk backup)
----------------------------------------
# Daftar gratis di https://twelvedata.com/pricing
# Free: 800 req/hari, 8 req/menit
# Tanpa key, bot masih jalan (cuma Yahoo aja)
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=paste_twelvedata_api_key
